WEBVTT

00:02.540 --> 00:05.590
<i>We've fought
two races on Oban already,</i>

00:05.840 --> 00:08.340
<i>but have yet to score
a single point.</i>

00:08.880 --> 00:12.010
<i>Our opponents, and Oban itself,</i>

00:12.470 --> 00:15.430
<i>are proving to be
a lot tougher than I expected.</i>

00:19.140 --> 00:22.400
<i>I'm starting to wonder
if I'll ever see my mother again.</i>

00:23.070 --> 00:26.650
<i>I need the Ultimate Prize
to make us a family again.</i>

00:26.990 --> 00:29.200
<i>I've got to keep on fighting.</i>

00:29.530 --> 00:30.910
<i>I've got to.</i>

01:50.610 --> 01:52.150
OK, OK.

01:52.700 --> 01:54.700
School starts late today.

02:14.430 --> 02:16.010
Another earthquake.

02:16.220 --> 02:18.260
It's Obanquake, actually.

02:19.220 --> 02:21.310
Good thing we're not
on the ground for this one.

02:28.230 --> 02:30.190
Listen. Do you hear that?

02:30.940 --> 02:32.490
It's those creatures.

02:32.650 --> 02:34.030
They're singing again.

02:34.200 --> 02:36.200
Oh great.
Let them eat somebody else.

02:43.250 --> 02:44.500
It's strange.

02:44.870 --> 02:48.880
The tremor didn't scare them.
They sound... peaceful.

02:49.130 --> 02:50.170
Almost happy-

02:51.130 --> 02:52.800
Whatever.

03:07.060 --> 03:08.400
Show's over, Molly.

03:08.560 --> 03:10.650
Come back inside
before you catch a cold.

03:10.860 --> 03:11.610
Hey!

03:20.160 --> 03:22.290
I guess we should get ready.

03:22.990 --> 03:28.130
Yeah, I've got lots of things
to do before the race.

03:44.060 --> 03:45.020
<i>'Nun.</i>

03:59.450 --> 04:00.660
Good morning, sir.

04:04.040 --> 04:06.410
Any special
recommendations for today?

04:09.880 --> 04:12.340
In the midst
of our ongoing misfortune,

04:13.000 --> 04:15.630
we have at least
one consolation.

04:16.050 --> 04:19.130
None of our adversaries
have scored more than once,

04:19.300 --> 04:21.260
with the exception of Sul.

04:21.550 --> 04:23.260
That makes Sul the leader.

04:24.100 --> 04:27.350
-But if we can make points...
-I understand.

04:29.480 --> 04:31.440
I'm counting on you
to catch up, Molly.

04:31.980 --> 04:34.230
We haven't fought so hard
to reach Oban

04:34.400 --> 04:37.070
just to let everything slip
through our fingers.

04:47.120 --> 04:48.210
Now, go.

04:48.830 --> 04:50.000
Yes, sir.

05:05.720 --> 05:07.890
I almost think
you believe in me.

05:24.910 --> 05:26.330
Koji, any sign of the gates?

05:30.500 --> 05:31.670
Looks like six total.

05:31.870 --> 05:34.880
But be careful, the first three
appear very close together.

05:36.380 --> 05:37.840
OK, got it.

05:39.380 --> 05:40.300
I see them.

05:58.480 --> 06:00.490
Enough of your arrogance, Sul.

06:26.680 --> 06:27.930
I've got him, Molly.

06:41.280 --> 06:42.820
Three more gates to go, Molly.

06:43.190 --> 06:44.700
We're in fourth place.

06:48.740 --> 06:50.120
I know I can get them.

06:59.340 --> 07:01.760
Hang on, Jordan.
We've got speed bumps ahead.

07:09.720 --> 07:10.390
No!

07:23.320 --> 07:24.690
Hey, what are these things?

07:24.860 --> 07:26.910
They're really cute.
I want one!

07:39.290 --> 07:41.040
Molly, you're veering
way off course!

07:41.540 --> 07:42.500
What's going on?

07:44.130 --> 07:47.550
I was finding Jordan a friend,
but we're back on track now.

07:55.140 --> 07:57.520
These humans are getting
a bit clingy, aren't they?

07:57.730 --> 07:59.850
Well, they do have
a female pilot.

08:00.310 --> 08:02.940
That doesn't make her
one of us, does it?

08:03.480 --> 08:04.940
Time to introduce ourselves.

08:14.370 --> 08:15.620
Where are they going?

08:21.840 --> 08:23.210
Ah! Here they are!

08:57.000 --> 08:58.000
Hey, what...

09:01.170 --> 09:03.040
Jordan? Are you all right?

09:19.060 --> 09:19.850
Molly...

09:24.610 --> 09:26.440
No use resisting, sweetie.

09:26.610 --> 09:27.650
I'm very strong!

09:28.070 --> 09:30.070
-And you're not.
-Back off, psycho alien!

09:34.120 --> 09:36.120
You should be worried
about yourself.

10:00.390 --> 10:01.180
Jordan?

10:03.650 --> 10:04.810
Don't worry about me.

10:04.980 --> 10:07.440
Just get the points.
We're in third position now.

10:11.690 --> 10:13.200
Sis, are you gonna be all right?

10:14.110 --> 10:15.200
Yeah, I'll live.

10:15.870 --> 10:16.870
Let's regroup.

10:45.690 --> 10:47.360
One more gate to go.

10:48.570 --> 10:50.570
All hope is not lost.

10:58.740 --> 11:01.790
An eye for an eye
just won't be enough this time.

11:06.750 --> 11:07.750
We did it, Jordan!

11:12.420 --> 11:13.300
What's going on?

11:15.590 --> 11:17.260
It's some kind of plasma blast.

11:17.720 --> 11:19.100
And it's heat-seeking!

11:19.930 --> 11:21.430
Molly, bank away!

11:21.850 --> 11:22.720
I'm nearly there.

11:23.270 --> 11:24.930
You have no choice!
They're right behind you!

11:25.560 --> 11:27.060
You won't have
enough time to escape!

11:27.650 --> 11:29.360
Sir, say something!
What should we do?

11:31.480 --> 11:33.150
Are you really sure
she can't make it?

11:33.480 --> 11:34.150
Sir?

11:36.150 --> 11:37.450
Molly, abort!

11:37.610 --> 11:39.450
What good are points
if we're blown to bits?

11:43.490 --> 11:44.200
No!

11:44.750 --> 11:46.080
Here goes nothing.

12:45.140 --> 12:47.640
How about a little cup
of Jordan's Java Jolt?

12:50.650 --> 12:52.110
Sure. Thank you.

12:55.190 --> 12:57.820
Is Don Wei still hiding
in his room?

13:02.910 --> 13:04.830
That man is totally heartless.

13:05.030 --> 13:07.750
Well, we did lose
for a third time in a row.

13:07.910 --> 13:09.870
He's entitled to be a little upset.

13:10.210 --> 13:11.330
Come on.

13:11.500 --> 13:14.250
At least he could speak to them.
It's just as hard for everyone.

13:14.790 --> 13:16.460
He's pushing them too far!

13:16.710 --> 13:18.300
Just makes me sick
to my stomach.

13:23.720 --> 13:25.640
Hey, thanks
for saving our necks.

13:26.390 --> 13:28.060
That was amazing flying.

13:28.810 --> 13:30.480
Where did you get that trick?

13:30.730 --> 13:32.150
I have no idea.

13:32.650 --> 13:34.230
It was just instinct, I guess.

13:35.900 --> 13:37.780
You're really something, aren't ya?

13:47.240 --> 13:50.580
You know, Molly,
I'm proud to be your partner.

13:53.040 --> 13:55.840
And maybe a little bit
more than that.

13:57.090 --> 13:59.800
After all we've been through,
you and I...

14:00.340 --> 14:03.260
Well, I mean, we should...

14:03.930 --> 14:05.970
Listen.
They're singing again.

14:08.100 --> 14:09.680
Oh? Really?

14:14.060 --> 14:15.100
Why now?

14:15.270 --> 14:17.110
We haven't felt
any tremors lately.

14:28.280 --> 14:30.750
Molly, what I was trying to say...

14:31.290 --> 14:32.460
was <i>maybe...</i>

14:33.080 --> 14:34.170
you and me...

14:34.370 --> 14:37.460
Look at that! There's some kind
of procession down there.

14:44.050 --> 14:46.640
If you're thinking of checking it out
with the Whizzing Arrow,

14:47.010 --> 14:49.010
I really don't think
that's an option right now.

14:55.140 --> 14:58.690
I never miss a music recital.
Would you care to join me?

15:02.690 --> 15:05.700
Molly, we can't do this.
Don Wei will kill us.

15:06.700 --> 15:08.160
Couldn't be much worse.

15:08.700 --> 15:10.490
I warn you, I'm staying here.

15:11.160 --> 15:13.120
No need to worry, Jordan.

15:13.410 --> 15:14.540
Molly's in good hands.

15:23.130 --> 15:23.920
Sorry, Aikka,

15:24.090 --> 15:26.430
but I wouldn't trust you
with Molly in a million years.

15:42.730 --> 15:43.940
Shh.

16:03.590 --> 16:05.300
Still willing to go on?

16:05.720 --> 16:07.090
Well, of course we are.

16:07.260 --> 16:09.010
We've met these creatures
before, you know?

16:09.930 --> 16:13.510
But, if it's too much for you
to handle, you can wait here.

16:28.030 --> 16:30.320
Let's go this way.
I think it's a shortcut.

17:00.850 --> 17:02.860
Oh, brilliant shortcut, Jordan.

17:03.020 --> 17:04.820
We should just
announce ourselves.

17:28.630 --> 17:29.550
Molly! The stone!

17:33.050 --> 17:34.220
I've got you, Molly!

17:43.650 --> 17:46.320
Shh! Get down.
Do you want us to be spotted?

17:51.070 --> 17:52.200
Oh, look.

17:52.360 --> 17:54.530
The stones are all
converging in the center.

18:06.380 --> 18:08.000
They're building a new temple.

18:24.650 --> 18:26.230
I think we should leave now.

18:26.440 --> 18:27.480
Agreed.

19:09.860 --> 19:11.070
Thanks for the lift!

19:18.320 --> 19:20.410
Yeah, see you
at the next race, buddy!

19:20.660 --> 19:22.500
Flying behind us.

19:33.630 --> 19:34.880
Don't sweat it, Molly.

19:35.050 --> 19:38.340
I'm sure his spirits will be back
in time for tomorrow's race, OK?

19:38.510 --> 19:40.470
I don't care
how he feels about us.

19:40.640 --> 19:41.970
We have to do much better.

19:42.140 --> 19:43.850
We don't have a choice.

19:47.980 --> 19:50.360
-Good night, Jordan.
-Good night, Molly.

20:05.910 --> 20:06.830
<i>Ladies and gentlemen,</i>

20:07.000 --> 20:09.710
<i>the next performance
is extremely dangerous.</i>

20:09.880 --> 20:11.040
<i>We remind everyone,</i>

20:11.250 --> 20:13.590
<i>no flash pictures, please.</i>

20:13.840 --> 20:18.050
<i>No one has ever dared to attempt
this stunt with a star-racer.</i>

20:18.550 --> 20:19.550
<i>Even.</i>

20:50.040 --> 20:52.080
She did it, Daddy.
She did it!

20:56.050 --> 20:59.970
Mommy's really the best.
Nothing could ever happen to her.

21:04.010 --> 21:05.260
Of course not.

21:13.560 --> 21:16.030
No. No! It can't be.

21:16.780 --> 21:18.110
It's impossible.
